{"id":11112,"artist":"Queen","title":"We Will Rock You","lyrics_plain":"%-%-%-\nBuddy, you're a boy,\nmake a big noise playing in the street,\ngonna be a big man some day.\nYou got mud on your face,\nyou big disgrace,\nkicking your can all over the place.\nSinging,\nWe will, we will rock you.\nWe will, we will rock you.\nBuddy, you're a young man, hard man,\nshouting in the street,\ngonna take on the world some day.\nYou got blood on your face,\nyou big disgrace,\nwaving your banner all over the place.\nWe will, we will rock you.\nSing it now!\nWe will, we will rock you.\nBuddy, you're an old man, poor man,\npleading with your eyes,\ngonna make you some peace some day.\nYou got mud on your face,\nbig disgrace,\nsomebody better put you back into your place.\nWe will, we will rock you.\nSing it!\nWe will, we will rock you.\nEverybody,\nWe will, we will rock you.\nAh,\nWe will, we will rock you. %+\nAlright now!%+%+","lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] %-%-%-\n[00:14.63] Buddy, you're a boy,\n[00:15.74] make a big noise playing in the street,\n[00:17.93] gonna be a big man some day.\n[00:19.95] You got mud on your face,\n[00:21.76] you big disgrace,\n[00:23.42] kicking your can all over the place.\n[00:25.97] Singing,\n[00:26.34] We will, we will rock you.\n[00:32.20] We will, we will rock you.\n[00:38.04] Buddy, you're a young man, hard man,\n[00:40.24] shouting in the street,\n[00:41.34] gonna take on the world some day.\n[00:43.36] You got blood on your face,\n[00:45.20] you big disgrace,\n[00:46.83] waving your banner all over the place.\n[00:49.76] We will, we will rock you.\n[00:54.48] Sing it now!\n[00:55.62] We will, we will rock you.\n[01:01.46] Buddy, you're an old man, poor man,\n[01:03.65] pleading with your eyes,\n[01:04.76] gonna make you some peace some day.\n[01:06.78] You got mud on your face,\n[01:08.77] big disgrace,\n[01:09.87] somebody better put you back into your place.\n[01:13.16] We will, we will rock you.\n[01:17.37] Sing it!\n[01:19.02] We will, we w